  "description": "Freeman's all-new 2nd Generation Pneumatic 15 Degree Coil Roofing Nailer has been completely redesigned with contractors' needs in mind. Re-engineered internal components, top of the line features, and enhanced driving power make this roofing nailer more powerful and reliable than ever before. This durable air powered nail gun delivers high-quality performance for your next project installing asphalt and cedar shingles, roof and wall sheathing, flooring underlayment, siding, shipping crate assembly, and wood fences. Optimized airflow and upgraded internal parts provide increased power with less air consumption, while also allowing for quick and easy repairs. Designed for maximum comfort and control, other features include a select fire trigger, tool-free depth of drive, a transparent bucket, a shingle guide, and an updated textured grip. The Freeman 2nd Generation Pneumatic 15 Degree Coil Roofing Nailer comes with a 1/4\" NPT air connector, and is backed by an industry-leading 7 Year Professional Warranty and 90 Day Wearable Parts Warranty.",
